# Line endings (platform COPILOT-4, 2026-09-03, applied preventively): shell scripts, Python, YAML,
# JSON and TOML are LF in the repository. A script committed with CRLF fails on Linux
# (`set -euo pipefail\r`: "invalid option name"). Binary/office files stay opaque.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.pptx  binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.drawio text eol=lf
